      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Secrets Strategy**\n\nI've decided to use AWS Secrets Manager. Now I need to figure out how to programmatically interact with it within `fetch_api_key.py`.\n\n\n**Implementing Secrets Retrieval**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the secrets retrieval. I've chosen `boto3` for AWS Secrets Manager interaction within `fetch_api_key.py`. I'll write code that uses the `boto3` client to fetch a secret. The plan is to include provider-specific elements like the `boto3` library and the `client('secretsmanager')` call, along with a placeholder for the secret name. I'll make the code provider-identifiable.\n\n\n",
